<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Welcome to HariHariBol</title>
  <%- include('../_style') %>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Welcome<%= name ? `, ${name}` : '' %></h1>

    <p>Your account is ready. A few things worth knowing:</p>

    <div class="card">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">Set your three languages</h2>
      <p class="meaning">
        The app you read, the script you chant in, and the language you read meanings in are
        three separate choices. They can all differ, or all match.
      </p>

      <h2>Start your sadhana</h2>
      <p class="meaning">
        Set a daily round target and chant in the app, or enter your rounds afterwards if you
        chant on beads.
      </p>

      <h2>A sloka each day</h2>
      <p class="meaning">
        A verse from the Bhagavad Gita or the Srimad Bhagavatam, every morning.
      </p>
    </div>

    <footer class="muted">
      <p>HariHariBol &middot; <%= year %></p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
